{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788257657010,"sessionID":"ses_fa39bca00ffeV1iObla3wLMRAJ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-99f578af92197007","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-ad7c1ce592bf/brsoccer/mcp_server.py","newString":"        sd = _soccer_data()\n        code = q._resolve_competition(competition, default=\"serie_a\")\n        table = q.standings(sd, competition, season)\n        chosen = season if season is not None else sd.seasons_for(code)[-1]\n        return fmt.format_standings(table, COMPETITIONS[code], chosen)","oldString":"        sd = _soccer_data()\n        table = q.standings(sd, competition, season)\n        chosen = table[0] and season or (season or sd.seasons_for(q._resolve_competition(competition, default=\"serie_a\"))[-1])\n        return fmt.format_standings(table, COMPETITIONS[q._resolve_competition(competition, default=\"serie_a\")], chosen)"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-ad7c1ce592bf/brsoccer/mcp_server.py\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-ad7c1ce592bf/brsoccer/mcp_server.py\n+++ /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-ad7c1ce592bf/brsoccer/mcp_server.py\n@@ -187,11 +187,12 @@\n     The leader is marked 'Champion'. For cups, use search_matches with\n     stage='final' instead.\n     \"\"\"\n     sd = _soccer_data()\n+    code = q._resolve_competition(competition, default=\"serie_a\")\n     table = q.standings(sd, competition, season)\n-    chosen = table[0] and season or (season or sd.seasons_for(q._resolve_competition(competition, default=\"serie_a\"))[-1])\n-    return fmt.format_standings(table, COMPETITIONS[q._resolve_competition(competition, default=\"serie_a\")], chosen)\n+    chosen = season if season is not None else sd.seasons_for(code)[-1]\n+    return fmt.format_standings(table, COMPETITIONS[code], chosen)\n \n @server.tool()\n def relegation(competition: str = \"serie_a\", season: int | None = None, n: int = 4) -> str:\n     \"\"\"Bottom N teams of a league table (the relegated zone, default 4).\"\"\"\n","filediff":{"file":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-ad7c1ce592bf/brsoccer/mcp_server.py","patch":"Index: /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-ad7c1ce592bf/brsoccer/mcp_server.py\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-ad7c1ce592bf/brsoccer/mcp_server.py\n+++ /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-ad7c1ce592bf/brsoccer/mcp_server.py\n@@ -187,11 +187,12 @@\n     The leader is marked 'Champion'. For cups, use search_matches with\n     stage='final' instead.\n     \"\"\"\n     sd = _soccer_data()\n+    code = q._resolve_competition(competition, default=\"serie_a\")\n     table = q.standings(sd, competition, season)\n-    chosen = table[0] and season or (season or sd.seasons_for(q._resolve_competition(competition, default=\"serie_a\"))[-1])\n-    return fmt.format_standings(table, COMPETITIONS[q._resolve_competition(competition, default=\"serie_a\")], chosen)\n+    chosen = season if season is not None else sd.seasons_for(code)[-1]\n+    return fmt.format_standings(table, COMPETITIONS[code], chosen)\n \n @server.tool()\n def relegation(competition: str = \"serie_a\", season: int | None = None, n: int = 4) -> str:\n     \"\"\"Bottom N teams of a league table (the relegated zone, default 4).\"\"\"\n","additions":3,"deletions":2},"truncated":false},"title":"brsoccer/mcp_server.py","time":{"start":1788257657006,"end":1788257657008}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"There's a messy line in `standings` tool:\n```python\nchosen = table[0] and season or (season or sd.seasons_for(...)[-1])\n```\nThat's convoluted and buggy-looking (`table[0] and season` — table[0] is a truthy TableRow, so `table[0] and season` → season if table non-empty... then `or (season or latest)` → if season None → latest). Actually it evaluates: if table non-empty and season set → season; if season None → latest. It \"works\" but is ugly. Let me simplify:\n\n```python\ncode = q._resolve_competition(competition, default=\"serie_a\")\nchosen = season if season is not None else sd.seasons_for(code)[-1]\nreturn fmt.format_standings(table, COMPETITIONS[code], chosen)\n```\n\nAlso `q._resolve_competition` is a private function being used from mcp_server — acceptable within the package, but cleaner to expose a public alias. I'll keep it but it's used consistently. Fine.\n\nFix the standings tool. Then write pyproject.toml + requirements.txt, then smoke-test the server + tools, then write tests.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05c7659cd001JCW0sHvw9gvZ42","sessionID":"ses_fa39bca00ffeV1iObla3wLMRAJ","messageID":"msg_05c7643e8001uXUYdEuM1VTtYF"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788257659741,"sessionID":"ses_fa39bca00ffeV1iObla3wLMRAJ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-b373ea46b9f090b5","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"[build-system]\nrequires = [\"setuptools>=68\"]\nbuild-backend = \"setuptools.build_meta\"\n\n[project]\nname = \"brsoccer-mcp\"\nversion = \"2.0.0\"\ndescription = \"MCP server for Brazilian soccer data (Brasileirao, Copa do Brasil, Libertadores, FIFA players)\"\nreadme = \"README.md\"\nrequires-python = \">=3.10\"\nlicense = { text = \"MIT\" }\ndependencies = [\n    \"mcp>=2.0,<3\",\n]\n\n[project.optional-dependencies]\ndev = [\n    \"pytest>=8\",\n    \"pytest-cov\",\n]\n\n[project.scripts]\nbrsoccer-mcp = \"brsoccer.mcp_server:main\"\n\n[tool.setuptools]\npackages = [\"brsoccer\"]\n\n[tool.pytest.ini_options]\ntestpaths = [\"tests\"]\naddopts = \"-q\"\nmarkers = [\n    \"bdd: BDD scenario tests (Given/When/Then)\",\n    \"integration: end-to-end MCP protocol tests over stdio\",\n    \"performance: query latency guard tests\",\n]\n","filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-ad7c1ce592bf/pyproject.toml"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-ad7c1ce592bf/pyproject.toml","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"pyproject.toml","time":{"start":1788257659734,"end":1788257659740}},"id":"prt_05c7660ba0011jZ9s7gzncUiDN","sessionID":"ses_fa39bca00ffeV1iObla3wLMRAJ","messageID":"msg_05c7643e8001uXUYdEuM1VTtYF"}}
