{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788257669307,"sessionID":"ses_fa39bca00ffeV1iObla3wLMRAJ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-a26ccd4bef8c51e4","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"./venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nimport asyncio\nfrom brsoccer.data import load_default\nfrom brsoccer.mcp_server import build_server\n\nsd = load_default()\nserver = build_server(sd)\n\nasync def main():\n    tools = await server.list_tools()\n    print(\"TOOLS:\", [t.name for t in tools])\n    print()\n    calls = [\n        (\"search_matches\", {\"team\": \"Flamengo\", \"opponent\": \"Fluminense\", \"limit\": 5}),\n        (\"head_to_head\", {\"team_a\": \"Palmeiras\", \"team_b\": \"Santos\"}),\n        (\"team_stats\", {\"team\": \"Corinthians\", \"season\": 2022, \"competition\": \"serie_a\"}),\n        (\"standings\", {\"competition\": \"serie_a\", \"season\": 2019}),\n        (\"relegation\", {\"season\": 2020}),\n        (\"search_players\", {\"nationality\": \"Brazil\", \"min_overall\": 88}),\n        (\"search_players\", {\"club\": \"Atlético Mineiro\"}),\n        (\"club_overview\", {}),\n        (\"competition_stats\", {\"competition\": \"serie_a\"}),\n        (\"biggest_wins\", {\"competition\": \"libertadores\", \"limit\": 3}),\n        (\"best_records\", {\"venue\": \"away\", \"min_matches\": 100}),\n        (\"derbies\", {\"season\": 2019}),\n        (\"last_match\", {\"team\": \"Flamengo\", \"opponent\": \"Corinthians\"}),\n        (\"team_competitions\", {\"team\": \"Palmeiras\"}),\n        (\"find_team\", {\"name\": \"Athletico\"}),\n        (\"competition_info\", {}),\n        (\"data_summary\", {}),\n        (\"search_matches\", {\"competition\": \"copa_do_brasil\", \"stage\": \"8\", \"limit\": 5}),\n        (\"search_matches\", {\"team\": \"Palmeiras\", \"season\": 2023, \"limit\": 4}),\n    ]\n    for name, args in calls:\n        res = await server.call_tool(name, args)\n        text = res.content[0].text if res.content else \"(no content)\"\n        print(f\"=== {name} {args} ===\")\n        print(\"\\n\".join(text.splitlines()[:12]))\n        print()\n        assert res.is_error is False, (name, text)\n\nasyncio.run(main())\nEOF"},"output":"TOOLS: ['find_team', 'search_matches', 'head_to_head', 'team_stats', 'last_match', 'team_competitions', 'standings', 'relegation', 'competition_info', 'competition_stats', 'biggest_wins', 'best_records', 'derbies', 'search_players', 'club_overview', 'data_summary']\n\n=== search_matches {'team': 'Flamengo', 'opponent': 'Fluminense', 'limit': 5} ===\nFlamengo vs Fluminense matches:\n- 2023-11-11: Flamengo 1-1 Fluminense (Brasileirão Série A)\n- 2023-07-16: Fluminense 0-0 Flamengo (Brasileirão Série A)\n- 2023-06-02: Flamengo 2-0 Fluminense (Copa do Brasil)\n- 2023-05-17: Fluminense 0-0 Flamengo (Copa do Brasil)\n- 2022-09-18: Flamengo 1-2 Fluminense (Brasileirão Série A Round 27)\nNote: other matching teams: Flamengo do Piauí-PI (4)\n\n=== head_to_head {'team_a': 'Palmeiras', 'team_b': 'Santos'} ===\nPalmeiras vs Santos head-to-head:\n\n2023-10-08: Palmeiras 1-2 Santos (Brasileirão Série A)\n2023-05-21: Santos 0-0 Palmeiras (Brasileirão Série A)\n2022-09-18: Palmeiras 1-0 Santos (Brasileirão Série A Round 27)\n2022-05-29: Santos 0-1 Palmeiras (Brasileirão Série A Round 8)\n2021-11-07: Santos 0-2 Palmeiras (Brasileirão Série A Round 30)\n2021-07-10: Palmeiras 3-2 Santos (Brasileirão Série A Round 11)\n2020-12-05: Santos 2-2 Palmeiras (Brasileirão Série A Round 24)\n2020-08-23: Palmeiras 2-1 Santos (Brasileirão Série A Round 5)\n2020-01-30: Palmeiras 1-0 Santos (Copa Libertadores final)\n2019-10-09: Santos 2-0 Palmeiras (Brasileirão Série A Round 24)\n\n=== team_stats {'team': 'Corinthians', 'season': 2022, 'competition': 'serie_a'} ===\nCorinthians (2022, Brasileirão Série A) record in dataset:\n\nOverall:\n- Matches: 38\n- Wins: 18, Draws: 11, Losses: 9\n- Goals For: 44, Goals Against: 36\n- Win rate: 47.4%\n\nHome:\n- Matches: 19\n- Wins: 12, Draws: 4, Lo