{"type":"text","timestamp":1788257795032,"sessionID":"ses_fa39bca00ffeV1iObla3wLMRAJ","part":{"id":"prt_05c786b3c001y5IHErrdEvWNU6","messageID":"msg_05c782944001PScSeMctI4B03q","sessionID":"ses_fa39bca00ffeV1iObla3wLMRAJ","type":"text","text":"Vitória resolution is correct — Bahia (Série A) and Vitória (Série B) genuinely didn't meet in 2023. One cosmetic fix: strip designator tokens from display names (\"EC Bahia\" → \"Bahia\"):","time":{"start":1788257790780,"end":1788257795027}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788257795042,"sessionID":"ses_fa39bca00ffeV1iObla3wLMRAJ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-978cb45edec051cb","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-ad7c1ce592bf/brsoccer/normalize.py","newString":"    def _pick_display(self, entry: TeamEntry) -> str:\n        def quality(raw: str) -> tuple:\n            count = entry.variants[raw]\n            has_accent = any(unicodedata.combining(ch) for ch in unicodedata.normalize(\"NFD\", raw))\n            return (count, has_accent, len(raw))\n\n        best = max(entry.variants, key=quality)\n        # Drop noisy parentheticals; tidy \"Name - SP\" into \"Name-SP\".\n        display = _split_parenthetical(best)[0].strip(\" -\") or best\n        display = re.sub(r\"\\s*[-\\u2013]\\s*\", \"-\", display)\n        # Cosmetic: strip designator tokens from the edges (\"EC Bahia\" -> \"Bahia\").\n        tokens = display.split()\n        while len(tokens) > 1 and tokens[0].lower() in LEADING_DESIGNATORS:\n            tokens.pop(0)\n        while len(tokens) > 1 and tokens[-1].lower() in TRAILING_DESIGNATORS:\n            tokens.pop()\n        return \" \".join(tokens)","oldString":"    def _pick_display(self, entry: TeamEntry) -> str:\n        def quality(raw: str) -> tuple:\n            count = entry.variants[raw]\n            has_accent = any(unicodedata.combining(ch) for ch in unicodedata.normalize(\"NFD\", raw))\n            return (count, has_accent, len(raw))\n\n        best = max(entry.variants, key=quality)\n        # Drop noisy parentheticals; tidy \"Name - SP\" into \"Name-SP\".\n        display = _split_parenthetical(best)[0].strip(\" -\") or best\n        return re.sub(r\"\\s*[-\\u2013]\\s*\", \"-\", display)"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-ad7c1ce592bf/brsoccer/normalize.py\n====================