therlands\", \"usa\": \"united states\", \"potuguesa\"...}\ndef _norm_nationality(text): n = _preprocess(text); return _NATIONALITY_ALIASES.get(n, n)\n```\nUse in search_players + club_overview.\n\n**C. Tests updates:**\n- test_mcp_protocol: `serverInfo`→`server_info`; `inputSchema`→`input_schema`; `result.isError`→`result.is_error` (3 places).\n- test_derbies_2019: drop Ba-Vi from expected; assert {\"Fla-Flu\",\"GreNal\",\"Clássico Majestoso\",\"Atletiba\"} <= names.\n- test_sample_questions: derbies 2019 expected [\"Fla-Flu\", \"GreNal\", \"Ba-Vi\"] → drop Ba-Vi → [\"Fla-Flu\", \"GreNal\", \"Clássico Majestoso\"].\n- test_2019_relegated_teams: \"Avaí\" expected — after display fix should pass. Keep as is, verify.\n- test_standings_are_ordered_by_points: 2015→2016.\n- test_libertadores_dash_goals: >= 3 → == 2? Make it: exactly 2 unplayed; assert the abandoned Boca-River 2015-05-14 match among them. Rename test.\n- test_gabriel_barbosa: accent-stripped check.\n- test_club_overview_groups: relax all-20.\n- test_nationality accent-insensitive — will pass after alias fix.\n\n**D. Also test_display_names_keep_accents**: after display fix, avai → \"Avaí\" hopefully ✓ keep test.\n\nLet me apply the code fixes first.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05c7e654c001frPp4yHMKbfr0X","sessionID":"ses_fa39bca00ffeV1iObla3wLMRAJ","messageID":"msg_05c7e2fab001dwNxcqoLO9sj6a"}}
